{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤔᤳᤋᤡ","commonName":"ᤔᤳᤋᤡ","title":"ᤔᤳᤋᤡᤖᤧ ᤛᤠᤵᤋᤢᤒᤠ ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤁᤢᤛᤢᤏᤠᤀᤡᤱ","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"92251ee343eb432e145aaeea5c2136c2828b4ff041495bf1aae6bdd263284826","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤆᤠᤃᤧᤏᤠ᤺ᤰᤐᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤛᤫᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠᤱ ᤐᤡᤔᤠᤛᤡ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤜᤢ᤹ᤖᤢᤛᤡ᤹"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤕᤧᤛᤢᤖᤧ ᤕᤠᤶᤔᤥ ᤔᤧᤳᤋᤢᤛᤡ. “ᤛᤡᤱᤛᤡᤱ ᤕᤧᤰᤕᤧᤰ ᤗ᤹ᤖᤧᤶᤔᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ. ᤂᤡᤏᤡ᤹ ᤁᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢᤶᤒᤠ ᤛᤠᤶᤕᤥᤏᤡᤒᤠ ᤕᤠ᤺ᤶᤒᤰᤜᤠ᤹ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤔᤧᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤂᤡᤏᤡ᤹ ᤏᤠᤖᤠ ᤔᤧᤓᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤖ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤏᤠ ᤋᤃᤡ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤧᤶᤔᤡᤴᤏᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ ᤁᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢᤶᤏᤧ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤃᤪ ᤛᤠᤱᤃᤪᤠᤶᤐᤣᤍᤠᤱᤅᤥᤒᤠ ᤐᤠᤏᤢᤍᤡᤱ ᤐᤠ᤺ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤌᤣᤀᤠᤱ ᤁᤧᤱᤄᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤶᤔᤡᤴᤗᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤔᤧᤱᤃᤵᤔᤏᤠᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤁᤢᤈᤠ ᤁᤧᤒᤡᤖᤢᤛᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤘᤣ᤹ᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤔᤧᤄᤧᤵᤛᤢᤖ ᤔᤧᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤖ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤢᤰᤗᤠ ᤔᤧᤔᤢᤰᤂᤧᤴᤏᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥ ᤁᤢᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ ᤁᤧᤈᤡ᤺ᤵᤐᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤕᤜᤢᤍᤡ ᤆᤢᤶᤗᤢᤱᤜᤡᤶᤔᤥ ᤏᤢ ᤗᤠᤶᤗᤠᤶᤔᤥ ᤔᤏᤠᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤔᤧᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤏᤠᤖᤠ ᤔᤧᤓᤥ᤺ᤛᤢᤖ ᤑᤠ᤹ᤀᤠᤱ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢ᤹॥ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤧᤰᤂᤠᤀᤣ ᤔᤧᤳᤏᤧ᤹. ᤂᤧᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤜᤠᤱᤛᤧᤶᤔᤡᤱᤃ ᤋᤃᤡᤛᤠ ᤔᤧᤄᤥ᤺ᤛᤢ ᤔᤧᤛᤢᤖᤢᤀᤠᤱ ᤔᤧᤘᤠ᤹॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["ᤁᤖ ᤂᤧᤏᤧ᤹ ᤔᤧᤱᤃᤵᤔᤏᤠᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤁᤧᤒᤡᤖᤢᤛᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤘᤣ᤹ᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤔᤧᤴᤏᤡᤀᤣ ᤐᤡᤖᤧᤛᤧ᤹ᤀᤥ॥",{"noteId":29}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤣᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤁᤧᤒᤡᤖᤢᤛᤡᤒᤠ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤏᤡᤴ ᤛᤫᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠᤱ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤱᤗᤖᤥ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱᤗᤰ ᤛᤫᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤠᤱ ᤁᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢᤒᤠ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴ ᤁᤧᤏᤡ᤺ᤒᤠ ᤐᤠᤏᤢᤍᤡᤱ ᤁᤧᤶᤒᤠᤖᤧ ᤜᤠᤱ